        <div class="app-grid">
            <div class="input-panel">
                <div class="tool-header">
                    <h1>Universal QR Generator</h1>
                    <p>Convert website links or upload any file (PDF, JPG, PNG, ZIP, MP4, MP3) to generate a 100% functional QR Code instantly.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="tabs">
                    <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab('url')">🔗 Link / URL</button>
                    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('file')">📁 Upload File</button>
                </div>

                <!-- URL INPUT TAB -->
                <div id="url-tab" class="tab-content active">
                    <input type="text" id="url-input" class="input-box" placeholder="https://example.com or paste any link here...">
                    <button class="action-btn" onclick="generateURLQR()">Generate URL QR Code</button>
                </div>

                <!-- FILE UPLOAD TAB -->
                <div id="file-tab" class="tab-content">
                    <div class="drop-zone" id="drop-zone">
                        <div style="font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 8px;">📂</div>
                        <strong>Drag & Drop your file here</strong>
                        <p>or click to browse (PDF, Images, ZIP, Video, Audio, Docs)</p>
                        <input type="file" id="file-input" onchange="handleFileSelect(event)">
                    </div>
                    <div id="file-info" class="file-info"></div>
                    <button class="action-btn" id="file-btn" onclick="generateFileQR()">Generate File QR Code</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- PREVIEW PANEL -->
            <div class="preview-panel">
                <div id="qrcode"></div>
                <button id="download-btn" class="download-btn" onclick="downloadQR()">📥 Download High-Res PNG</button>
                <div id="status-msg" class="status-msg"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ad-container">
            </div>

        <!-- ARTICLE & GUIDE -->
        <article class="content-section">
            <h2>Ultimate Guide to Using the Universal QR Code Generator</h2>
            <p>Welcome to the most versatile, modern, and reliable online QR Code Generator. In today's hyper-connected digital landscape, transferring data between desktop screens, printed media, and mobile devices needs to be instantaneous. Our Universal QR Code Generator bridges that gap seamlessly by enabling users to encode both web links (URLs) and raw digital files (PDF, JPG, PNG, ZIP, MP4, Audio) directly into scannable matrix barcodes with 100% accuracy.</p>

            <h2>How to Use the Universal QR Code Generator</h2>
            <p>Generating a high-resolution QR code takes only a few seconds. Follow the simple steps outlined below based on your content type:</p>
            
            <h3>Method 1: Generating a QR Code for Web Links & Text</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Select the Link/URL Tab:</strong> Ensure the "Link / URL" option is highlighted at the top of the generator tool panel.</li>
                <li><strong>Enter Destination:</strong> Paste your desired website link, YouTube video URL, social media profile, or plain text message into the input field.</li>
                <li><strong>Generate Code:</strong> Click on the purple "Generate URL QR Code" button. Your personalized QR code will display instantly in the preview frame on the right side.</li>
                <li><strong>Download & Share:</strong> Click "Download High-Res PNG" to save the QR code image directly to your PC or mobile storage.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Method 2: Generating a QR Code from Local Files (PDF, Images, Video, ZIP)</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Select the Upload File Tab:</strong> Switch to the "Upload File" section within the tool panel.</li>
                <li><strong>Drag and Drop or Browse:</strong> Drag any local file (PDF, image, ZIP archive, video, or audio) and drop it into the upload area.</li>
                <li><strong>Process and Convert:</strong> Click "Generate File QR Code". Our system hosts your file securely via high-speed CDN / Cloud Storage and generates a clean, 100% scannable QR Code.</li>
                <li><strong>Save QR Code:</strong> Hit the green download button to retrieve your QR code image. Scanning the code opens your file instantly on any smartphone camera.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Key Benefits of Our Advanced Tool</h2>
            <p>Why choose our Universal QR Code Tool over standard online generators? Here are the primary benefits engineered for creators, businesses, and everyday users:</p>

            <h3>1. Universal File Format Support</h3>
            <p>Convert any media format—including Documents, Images, Audio, HD Videos, and Compressed ZIP Archives—into lightweight, instantly scannable QR Codes.</p>

            <h3>2. Fast & Secure File Delivery</h3>
            <p>All uploads are processed through encrypted cloud links to ensure super fast file preview and download speeds when scanned from Android or iOS devices.</p>

            <h3>3. Optimized Full-Screen Responsive UI</h3>
            <p>Designed with maximum screen real estate utilization in mind, the layout dynamically stretches across wide PC monitors, tablets, and mobile screens. Touch targets are large, typography is clean, and navigation is completely seamless regardless of device orientation.</p>

            <h3>4. Zero Cost & Unlimited Usage</h3>
            <p>No paywalls, hidden subscriptions, or account registration requirements. Create as many custom QR codes as you need for marketing campaigns, personal projects, business cards, menus, or educational materials free forever.</p>

            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
            <h3>Will my generated QR codes expire?</h3>
            <p>No! The QR codes generated by this tool are permanent and continuously direct users straight to your designated links and files.</p>

            <h3>What file types can I upload?</h3>
            <p>You can convert PDFs, JPGs, PNGs, MP4 videos, MP3 songs, Word documents, Excel sheets, and ZIP files into high-resolution QR codes.</p>
